      "spam": false,
      "value": "+1\n\nI've noticed that I can't touch the floor with any avatar, short or tall. I always end up hitting the real-world ground about a foot or two above the virtual one. Makes it almost impossible to pick stuff up.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
